{"parse":{"title":"A Caucus Prelude and a Long Tale","pageid":467757,"revid":2141643,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A Caucus Prelude and a Long Tale</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/16/Talent_A_Caucus_Prelude_and_a_Long_Tale.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122053\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent A Caucus Prelude and a Long Tale\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/16/Talent_A_Caucus_Prelude_and_a_Long_Tale.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122053\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/16/Talent_A_Caucus_Prelude_and_a_Long_Tale.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122053 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/16/Talent_A_Caucus_Prelude_and_a_Long_Tale.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122053 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent A Caucus Prelude and a Long Tale\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_A_Caucus_Prelude_and_a_Long_Tale.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent A Caucus Prelude and a Long Tale.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When Sandrone is in the <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a>, you will gain additional snack rewards after turning in your Daily Commissions with Katheryne.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>A Caucus Prelude and a Long Tale</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FA_Caucus_Prelude_and_a_Long_Tale%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Sandrone must be in the active party for A Caucus Prelude and a Long Tale to take effect, but she does not need to be alive.</li>\n<li>Rewards one of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tea_Party_Prelude:_Artful_Latte\" title=\"Tea Party Prelude: Artful Latte\"><img alt=\"Tea Party Prelude: Artful Latte\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Tea Party Prelude Artful Latte.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Tea_Party_Prelude_Artful_Latte.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/ff/Item_Tea_Party_Prelude_Artful_Latte.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260703204236\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tea_Party_Prelude:_Artful_Latte\" title=\"Tea Party Prelude: Artful Latte\"><img alt=\"Tea Party Prelude: Artful Latte\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Tea Party Prelude Artful Latte.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Tea_Party_Prelude_Artful_Latte.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/ff/Item_Tea_Party_Prelude_Artful_Latte.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260703204236\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Tea_Party_Prelude:_Artful_Latte\" title=\"Tea Party Prelude: Artful Latte\">Tea Party Prelude: Artful Latte</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tea_Party_Prelude:_Herbal_Tea\" title=\"Tea Party Prelude: Herbal Tea\"><img alt=\"Tea Party Prelude: Herbal Tea\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Tea Party Prelude Herbal Tea.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Tea_Party_Prelude_Herbal_Tea.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/6/66/Item_Tea_Party_Prelude_Herbal_Tea.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260701093712\" /></a></s